IMO off topics must be held exclusively in Lojban but ok. I disagree. I'm 
subscribed to the bpfk-list (and I want to be subsribed to it further) but 
i don't want to be it's member.
The BPFK is dead and must be recreated of fluent lojbanic speakers of which 
i'm  familiar with camgusmis, gejyspa, tsani, selpa'i, latro'a, xalbo, 
tengo.
Others must be forbidden to cast any votes. Sorry if I forgot someone and 
of course i dont force anyone to be a member of BPFK. I just mean that 
linguists or programmers even the most prominent can't say anything worth 
listening to unless they know and use a language.


